<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: ship part crash (fungoid)-->
  <VRE_FungoidShipPartCrash.label>船舶部分碰撞（蕈类）</VRE_FungoidShipPartCrash.label>
  <!--EN: Fungoid ship-->
  <VRE_FungoidShipPartCrash.letterLabel>蕈类船</VRE_FungoidShipPartCrash.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: A large piece of an ancient ship has crashed nearby.\n\nYour colonists have heard the stories of the dawn of space exploration and all the ancient vessels that went missing in outer space. Judging by the markings, it must be one of those vessels. They can hear scratching and growling emanating from the inside.\n\nDestroy it as soon as possible. But beware - something may emerge when you open fire at the ship.-->
  <VRE_FungoidShipPartCrash.letterText>一艘古代船只的一大块在附近坠毁。

你的殖民者听说过太空探索的黎明以及所有在外太空失踪的古代船只的故事。从标记来看，它一定是其中一艘。他们可以听到从内部传来的刮擦声和咆哮声。

尽快摧毁它。但要小心——当你向船开火时，可能会出现一些东西。</VRE_FungoidShipPartCrash.letterText>
</LanguageData>
